### 🚨 RACE 5: waitForLoad Reading Without Lock (HIGH)

**Location:** `waitForLoad()` lines 82-93

```go
entry, ok := c.data[key]  // Reading map without lock!
if ok && !entry.Loading {
    return entry.Value, nil
}
```

Same problem as Race 1 - reading the map while other goroutines might be writing.

---

### 🚨 RACE 6: Cache Stampede on Loading State (HIGH)

**Location:** `Get()` semantic race

If loading fails and we delete the entry, waiting goroutines in `waitForLoad` will spin forever or get stale data when a new load starts.

